# Compiled binaries are not committed — reproducible from source + the FQBN
# recorded in README.md, matching the convention in ST3215_Bench_Tools/.
build/

# Local Wi-Fi credentials (W1). The real file is created by the operator
# from src/config/WifiCredentials.local.h.example and must never be
# committed. scripts/static_audit.py FAILS the build if this entry is
# removed, so a passphrase cannot become committable by an unreviewed edit.
src/config/WifiCredentials.local.h
